   22 local_declarations: local_declarations var_declaration
   23                   | ε

   24 statement_list: statement_list statement
   25               | ε

   26 statement: expression_decl
   27          | compound_decl
   28          | selection_decl
   29          | iteration_decl
   30          | return_decl

   31 expression_decl: expression SEMICOLON
   32                | SEMICOLON
   33                | error SEMICOLON

   34 selection_decl: IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement
   35               | IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement ELSE statement
   36               | IF ABREPARENTESES error FECHAPARENTESES statement
   37               | IF ABREPARENTESES error FECHAPARENTESES statement ELSE statement

   38 iteration_decl: WHILE ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement
   39               | WHILE ABREPARENTESES error FECHAPARENTESES statement
   40               | WHILE error statement

   41 return_decl: RETURN SEMICOLON
   42            | RETURN expression SEMICOLON

   43 expression: var ATRIB expression
   44           | simple_expression

   45 var: ID
   46    | ID ABRECOLCHETES expression FECHACOLCHETES

   47 simple_expression: simple_expression relational sum_expression
   48                  | sum_expression

   49 relational: relational_operand

   50 relational_operand: EQ
   51                   | NEQ
   52                   | LT
   53                   | GT
   54                   | LET
   55                   | GET

   56 sum_expression: sum_expression sum term
   57               | term

   58 sum: SOMA
   59    | SUB

   60 term: term mult factor
   61     | factor

   62 mult: MULT
   63     | DIV

   64 factor: ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES
   65       | var
   66       | activation
   67       | NUM

   68 activation: fun_id ABREPARENTESES args FECHAPARENTESES

   69 args: arg_list
   70     | ε

   71 arg_list: arg_list COMMA expression
   72         | expression


